te $b = 3$ back into one of the equations. Let's choose the first equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n2a + 5b &= 19 \\\\\n2a + 5(3) &= 19 \\\\\n2a + 15 &= 19 \\\\\n2a &= 4 \\\\\na &= 2\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution to the system of equations is $a=2, \\,b=3$, which can be expressed as $(2,3)$." 13194139535469 17592186045443 true] [17592186509059 1075 #edb/ref 17592186509080 13194139535469 17592186045443 true] [17592186509059 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139535469 17592186045443 true] [17592186509059 1077 "field-1" 13194139535469 17592186045443 true] [17592186509059 1078 #edb/ref 17592186509080 13194139535469 17592186045443 true] [17592186509059 1079 #uuid "25eacce8-21cd-5065-b87b-8364d07c64a2" 13194139535469 17592186045443 true] [17592186509060 1080 "(-7, 17)" 13194139535469 17592186045443 true] [17592186509060 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535469 17592186045443 true] [17592186509060 1083 #uuid "2faf14ba-bba7-51c7-9edf-cecfc41c14b5" 13194139535469 17592186045443 true] [17592186509061 1080 "-5" 13194139535469 17592186045443 true] [17592186509061 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535469 17592186045443 true] [17592186509061 1083 #uuid "30017ff9-b626-5f0f-96bf-3f60d887385e" 13194139535469 17592186045443 true] [17592186509062 1080 "(- \\frac{1257}{41}, \\frac{201}{41})" 13194139535469 17592186045443 true] [17592186509062 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535469 17592186045443 true] [17592186509062 1083 #uuid "305a3950-6485-5d6d-9a0b-5b40b1148ce8" 13194139535469 17592186045443 true] [17592186509063 1080 "(\\frac{5}{4}, - \\frac{3}{4})" 13194139535469 17592186045443 true] [17592186509063 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535469 17592186045443 true] [17592186509063 1083 #uuid "329f0e6d-30d3-5076-b0f7-a3bfcc97b663" 13194139535469 17592186045443 true] [17592186509064 1080 "-2" 13194139535469 17592186045443 true] [17592186509064 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535469 17592186045443 true] [17592186509064 1083 #uuid "338fa4ef-f1d5-5f60-9